      "Title": "Wolfgang.LogCompressor.Framework.LoggingOptions",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.LogCompressor.Framework.LoggingOptions.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Strongly-typed logging configuration bound from the <code>Logging</code> section of\n<code>AppSettings.json</code>. Replaces the reflection-based\n<code>Serilog.Settings.Configuration</code> schema so the binding is performed by the\nsource-generated configuration binder (trim- and single-file-safe).</p>\n"
    },
