      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.LogCompressor.Framework.SerilogConfigurator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.LogCompressor.Framework.SerilogConfigurator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Applies a strongly-typed <xref href=\"Wolfgang.LogCompressor.Framework.LoggingOptions\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> to a Serilog\n<xref href=\"Serilog.LoggerConfiguration\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> in code. This replaces\n<code>LoggerConfiguration.ReadFrom.Configuration(...)</code> (which instantiates sinks\nby name via reflection) with an explicit, trim-safe configuration.</p>\n"
